; pnpm reads .npmrc — this is the only package-manager config file in the repo.
;
; There used to be both .npmrc (holding just a comment saying settings had moved)
; and .pnpmrc (holding these patterns). pnpm does not read .pnpmrc, so the patterns
; were never in effect. They are here now, in the file that is actually read.
;
; Hoisting the lint tooling to the root of node_modules keeps editor integrations
; and flat ESLint config able to resolve plugins by bare name.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*eslint*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*prettier*
